    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the post-apocalyptic world as a pilot in this intense top-down action roguelike. Command your customizable combat mech through bullet-hell battles while managing crucial systems like power distribution and heat levels. Each run presents unique challenges and opportunities as you collect relics that can dramatically alter your vehicle's capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Customization: Modify your vehicle with interchangeable parts including weapons, shields, coolers, power reactors, and hover pads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Power Management: Balance your vehicle's energy distribution and heat levels across systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike Elements: Discover and collect relics that provide unique buffs and debuffs, making each run different</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic Combat: Engage in tactical battles combining vehicular combat with bullet-hell elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced Power Control: Fine-tune power allocation to different systems for optimal performance</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the post-apocalyptic world as a pilot in this intense top-down action roguelike. Command your customizable combat mech through bullet-hell battles while managing crucial systems like power distribution and heat levels. Each run presents unique challenges and opportunities as you collect relics that can dramatically alter your vehicle's capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Customization: Modify your vehicle with interchangeable parts including weapons, shields, coolers, power reactors, and hover pads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Power Management: Balance your vehicle's energy distribution and heat levels across systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike Elements: Discover and collect relics that provide unique buffs and debuffs, making each run different</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic Combat: Engage in tactical battles combining vehicular combat with bullet-hell elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced Power Control: Fine-tune power allocation to different systems for optimal performance</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A tactical top-down action roguelike where you pilot a customizable vehicle through intense bullet-hell combat while managing power/heat systems and collecting game-changing relics.",
